---
import { models, sections } from "../data/capabilities.json";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" class="font-serif antialiased">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>OC-Free-Model-Video — Use OpenRouter's Free Router in OpenCode</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Step-by-step tutorial: install OpenCode, connect OpenRouter, and use the free router for small coding tasks and experiments. Styled like drjoshcsimmons.com." />
    <meta property="og:title" content="OC-Free-Model-Video" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="Use OpenRouter's free router in OpenCode for small coding tasks and experiments. The model can change between requests." />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://oc-free-model-video.vercel.app" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="OC-Free-Model-Video" />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="Use OpenRouter's free router in OpenCode for small coding tasks and experiments." />
    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "HowTo",
        "name": "Using OpenRouter's Free Router in OpenCode",
        "description": "Install OpenCode, connect OpenRouter, set the free router as default, and use it for small coding tasks.",
        "totalTime": "PT5M",
        "estimatedCost": {
          "@type": "MonetaryAmount",
          "currency": "USD",
          "value": "0"
        },
        "step": [
          { "@type": "HowToStep", "position": 1, "name": "Install OpenCode", "text": "Run: brew install anomalyco/tap/opencode" },
          { "@type": "HowToStep", "position": 2, "name": "Connect OpenRouter key", "text": "Launch opencode, type /connect, choose OpenRouter, paste key." },
          { "@type": "HowToStep", "position": 3, "name": "Set free router as default", "text": "Search and select openrouter/openrouter/free in the model picker." },
          { "@type": "HowToStep", "position": 4, "name": "Test it", "text": "Run opencode models openrouter, then test with a simple prompt." },
          { "@type": "HowToStep", "position": 5, "name": "Use in a project", "text": "Start opencode -m openrouter/openrouter/free and try a small task." }
        ]
      }
    </script>
    <style>
      :root {
        --ground: #f2efe8;
        --ink: #0a0a0a;
        --ink-muted: #6b6b6b;
        --ink-soft: #8a8a8a;
        --rule: #1a1a1a14;
        --accent: #2e1a47;
        --muted: #eeeae1;
        --font-display: "Newsreader", "Iowan Old Style", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
        --font-serif: "Newsreader", "Iowan Old Style", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
        --font-sans: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, "Noto Sans", sans-serif, "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji", "Segoe UI Symbol", "Noto Color Emoji";
        --font-mono: "JetBrainsMono", "SF Mono", Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", "Courier New", monospace;
      }

      [data-theme="dark"] {
        --ground: #171410;
        --ink: #e7e2d8;
        --ink-muted: #a39b8d;
        --ink-soft: #837b6f;
        --rule: #f2efe81a;
        --accent: #b3a1d6;
        --muted: #211d18;
      }

      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        :root:not([data-theme="light"]) {
          --ground: #171410;
          --ink: #e7e2d8;
          --ink-muted: #a39b8d;
          --ink-soft: #837b6f;
          --rule: #f2efe81a;
          --accent: #b3a1d6;
          --muted: #211d18;
        }
      }

      *, *::before, *::after {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
      }

      html, body {
        background: var(--ground);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-feature-settings: "kern", "liga", "onum";
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
        text-rendering: optimizelegibility;
        line-height: 1.5;
        min-height: 100vh;
      }

      body {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .layout {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 0;
        max-width: 72rem;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 1.5rem;
        width: 100%;
      }

      @media (min-width: 64rem) {
        .layout {
          grid-template-columns: 16rem 1fr;
          gap: 3rem;
          padding: 1.5rem;
        }
      }

      .toc {
        position: sticky;
        top: 1.5rem;
        align-self: start;
        max-height: calc(100vh - 3rem);
        overflow-y: auto;
      }

      .toc-title {
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        color: var(--ink-soft);
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      }

      .toc a {
        display: block;
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        color: var(--ink-muted);
        padding: 0.3rem 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
        transition: color 0.14s;
        line-height: 1.4;
      }

      .toc a:hover {
        color: var(--accent);
        border-bottom-color: var(--accent);
      }

      .toc a.active {
        color: var(--accent);
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      .toc-toggle {
        display: none;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        color: var(--ink-muted);
        background: transparent;
        border: 1px solid var(--rule);
        border-radius: 0.25rem;
        padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      @media (max-width: 63.99rem) {
        .toc {
          position: static;
          max-height: none;
          margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        .toc-body {
          display: none;
        }
        .toc-body.open {
          display: block;
        }
        .toc-toggle {
          display: inline-block;
        }
      }

      main {
        min-width: 0;
      }

      h1 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 1.4rem + 1.6vw, 2.75rem);
        line-height: 1.2;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      .subtitle {
        color: var(--accent);
        font-style: italic;
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        max-width: 42ch;
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      }

      section {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
        padding-top: 1.25rem;
        scroll-margin-top: 1rem;
      }

      section:first-child {
        border-top: none;
        padding-top: 0;
      }

      h2 {
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        color: var(--ink-soft);
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      }

      p {
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        max-width: 42ch;
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      strong {
        color: var(--ink);
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      code {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        background: var(--muted);
        color: var(--ink);
        padding: 0.2em 0.4em;
        border-radius: 0.2em;
        font-size: 0.9em;
      }

      pre {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        background: var(--muted);
        color: var(--ink);
        padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
        border-radius: 0.5rem;
        font-size: 0.9em;
        line-height: 1.55;
        overflow-x: auto;
        margin: 1.5rem 0;
      }

      ul {
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        max-width: 42ch;
        margin-left: 1.25rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      li {
        margin: 0.375rem 0;
      }

      a {
        color: var(--ink);
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: color 0.14s, border-color 0.14s;
      }

      a:hover {
        color: var(--accent);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--accent);
        padding-bottom: 0.5px;
      }

      hr {
        border: 0;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
        margin: 2rem 0;
      }

      /* === Components === */

      .theme-toggle {
        position: fixed;
        top: 1rem;
        right: 1rem;
        z-index: 50;
        background: var(--muted);
        border: 1px solid var(--rule);
        border-radius: 0.3rem;
        padding: 0.35rem 0.5rem;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--ink-muted);
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: color 0.14s;
      }

      .theme-toggle:hover {
        color: var(--accent);
        border-color: var(--accent);
      }

      .demo-box {
        background: var(--muted);
        border: 1px solid var(--rule);
        border-radius: 0.5rem;
        padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.85em;
        margin: 1.5rem 0;
      }

      .model-chip {
        display: inline-block;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--rule);
        border-radius: 0.3rem;
        background: var(--ground);
        color: var(--ink-soft);
        margin: 0.2rem;
      }

      table.cap-table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-size: 1.0625rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin: 1.5rem 0;
      }
      table.cap-table th,
      table.cap-table td {
        text-align: left;
        padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }
      table.cap-table th {
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        color: var(--ink-soft);
      }
      table.cap-table tr:hover td { background: var(--ground); }

      .calc-input {
        background: var(--ground);
        border: 1px solid var(--rule);
        border-radius: 0.3rem;
        padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem;
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--ink);
        width: 100px;
        text-align: right;
      }

      .project-card {
        background: var(--muted);
        border: 1px solid var(--rule);
        border-radius: 0.5rem;
        padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }
      .project-card h3 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        color: var(--ink);
      }
      .project-card p { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }

      .grid-2col {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr));
        gap: 0.5rem;
        margin: 1rem 0;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <button class="theme-toggle" onclick="toggleTheme()" title="Toggle dark/light">Aa</button>

    <div class="layout">
      <nav class="toc">
        <button class="toc-toggle" onclick="this.nextElementSibling.classList.toggle('open')">Index</button>
        <div class="toc-body" id="toc-body">
          <p class="toc-title">On this page</p>
          {
            sections.map((s: { id: string; title: string }) => (
              <a href={`#${s.id}`} class="toc-link">{s.id}. {s.title}</a>
            )
          )}
        </div>
      </nav>

      <main>
        <h1>OC-Free-Model-Video</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Use OpenRouter's free router in OpenCode for small coding tasks and experiments.</p>

        <p style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.125rem;line-height:1.7;max-width:42ch;margin-bottom:1.25rem;color:var(--ink-muted);">
          By <a href="https://drjoshcsimmons.com" style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;">Josh C. Simmons</a>
          &nbsp;·&nbsp;
          <a href="https://x.com/Dr_joshcsimmons" style="color:var(--ink);">X</a>
          &nbsp;·&nbsp;
          <a href="https://youtube.com/@drjoshcsimmons" style="color:var(--ink);">YouTube</a>
          &nbsp;·&nbsp;
          <a href="https://newsletter.drjoshcsimmons.com" style="color:var(--ink);">Newsletter</a>
        </p>

        <section id="1">
          <h2>1. Install OpenCode</h2>
          <p>On macOS with Homebrew, run:</p>
          <pre><code>brew install anomalyco/tap/opencode</code></pre>
          <p>If you already have OpenCode, skip this step. Other platforms can use the installation guide.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="2">
          <h2>2. Connect your OpenRouter key</h2>
          <p>Create an API key at OpenRouter. Then launch OpenCode:</p>
          <pre><code>opencode</code></pre>
          <p>Inside its terminal interface, type <code>/connect</code>, choose <strong>OpenRouter</strong>, and paste the key. OpenCode saves provider credentials separately from your config.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="3">
          <h2>3. Set the free router as your default</h2>
          <p>Search and select <code>openrouter/openrouter/free</code> in the model picker.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="4">
          <h2>4. Test it</h2>
          <p>Exit OpenCode and run:</p>
          <pre><code>opencode models openrouter
opencode run -m openrouter/openrouter/free "Reply with: setup works"</code></pre>
          <p>The model list should include <code>openrouter/openrouter/free</code>. A reply confirms that authentication and routing work.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="5">
          <h2>5. Use it in a project</h2>
          <p>From your project directory, start:</p>
          <pre><code>opencode -m openrouter/openrouter/free</code></pre>
          <p>Try a small task: "Read the README and explain how to run this project." Use <code>/models</code> to switch models later.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="6">
          <h2>6. Model capability reference</h2>
          <p>The free router dynamically selects models based on your request. Here are the capabilities you can expect from models currently rotated in (as of October 2026):</p>
          <table class="cap-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Model</th>
                <th>Tool Calling</th>
                <th>Vision</th>
                <th>Context</th>
                <th>Typical Use</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {
                models.map((m: { name: string; toolCalling: boolean; vision: boolean; context: string; use: string }) => (
                  <tr>
                    <td>{m.name}</td>
                    <td>{m.toolCalling ? "Yes" : "No"}</td>
                    <td>{m.vision ? "Yes" : "No"}</td>
                    <td>{m.context}</td>
                    <td>{m.use}</td>
                  </tr>
                )
              )}
            </tbody>
          </table>
          <p>Because the model can change between requests, always test critical capabilities like tool calling in your specific session. Use <code>/models</code> to pin to a specific model when you need consistency.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="7">
          <h2>7. If it fails</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>A model-not-found error: confirm the full ID <code>openrouter/openrouter/free</code> above and restart OpenCode.</li>
            <li>An authentication error: reconnect your OpenRouter key with <code>/connect</code>.</li>
            <li>Rate limit (429): wait before retrying and follow the retry delay in the error headers.</li>
            <li>Output too long: add a length or complexity constraint to the prompt.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Docs checked October 2, 2026.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="8">
          <h2>8. More from Josh</h2>
          <p>More on AI, taste, and the repricing of creative labor:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="https://drjoshcsimmons.com">drjoshcsimmons.com</a> — essays on taste, technology, and labor</li>
            <li><a href="https://x.com/Dr_joshcsimmons">x.com/Dr_joshcsimmons</a> — daily takes on AI and the creative economy</li>
            <li><a href="https://youtube.com/@drjoshcsimmons">youtube.com/@drjoshcsimmons</a> — long-form video essays</li>
            <li><a href="https://newsletter.drjoshcsimmons.com">newsletter.drjoshcsimmons.com</a> — a letter when there is something to say</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </main>
    </div>
    <script is:inline src="/demo.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>